sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Protocol Client
    participant Parser as Packet Parser
    participant Handler as Message Handler
    participant Server as Remote Server
    
    Note over Client,Server: Connection & Authentication
    Client->>Server: Connect
    Server-->>Client: Challenge
    Client->>Parser: Parse Challenge
    Parser-->>Client: Parsed Data
    Client->>Server: Auth Response
    Server-->>Client: Auth OK
    
    Note over Client,Server: Message Exchange
    Server->>Client: Game Message
    Client->>Parser: Parse Message
    Parser->>Handler: Dispatch
    Handler-->>Client: Process Complete
    
    Client->>Server: Player Action
    Server-->>Client: Action Result
